## 📊 Test Quality Metrics

### 1. **Coverage Metrics** 📈
- **Line Coverage**: Target >90% for critical components
- **Branch Coverage**: Test all conditional paths
- **Function Coverage**: Test all public functions
- **Integration Coverage**: Test component interactions

### 2. **Performance Metrics** ⚡
- **Test Execution Time**: Keep tests fast (<1 second for unit tests)
- **Memory Usage**: Monitor memory leaks during testing
- **CPU Usage**: Ensure tests don't consume excessive resources
- **Build Time**: Minimize test impact on build performance

### 3. **Reliability Metrics** 🎯
- **Flaky Test Rate**: <1% of tests should be flaky
- **False Positive Rate**: Minimize false test failures
- **Test Maintenance**: Easy to update when code changes
- **Documentation**: Clear test purpose and setup

